{"seq":5,"slug":"corporate-law","title":"公司法","stage":"DONE","category":"law-legal","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law","rating":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.31,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"公司法-简介\">公司法 简介</h1><p>公司法是技术创业者和技术管理者在创办、运营和发展企业过程中必须掌握的核心法律知识。从选择公司类型到股权融资，从日常合规到最终退出，每一个关键决策背后都有公司法的支撑。本知识库旨在帮助技术背景出身的创业者和 CTO 建立系统的公司法认知框架，理解法律对商业决策的实质影响。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于正在创业或计划创业的技术人员、担任 CTO 或技术合伙人角色的管理者，以及需要与法务团队高效协作的技术领导者。你不需要成为法律专家，但需要具备足够的法律素养来识别风险、提出正确的问题，并在关键时刻做出明智的商业判断。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>公司设立与治理</strong>系统介绍公司的设立流程和治理架构。你将了解不同公司类型的法律特征与适用场景，掌握公司注册的基本流程与注意事项，理解董事会、股东会等治理机构的权责分配，以及股东作为公司所有者所享有的权利与应承担的义务。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>公司融资法律</strong>聚焦于技术公司最常面临的融资法律问题。从天使轮到 IPO 前的各轮股权融资，到银行贷款和可转债等债权融资工具，再到风险投资中的条款清单与交割流程，以及员工股权激励计划的设计与实施，本章为你提供完整的融资法律地图。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>公司运营合规</strong>覆盖技术公司日常运营中最易触碰的法律红线。数据合规与隐私保护是技术公司的重中之重，税法基础知识帮助你理解企业税务义务，反垄断与反不正当竞争规则约束着市场竞争行为，行业监管与合规则关注特定行业的准入和运营要求。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>公司变更与退出</strong>探讨企业生命周期后期的重大法律事件。并购与重组涉及企业控制权的转移与整合，IPO 基础知识为上市之路提供法律准备，公司解散与清算处理企业终止时的法律程序，创业公司法律实务则从全局视角串联创业过程中的典型法律场景。</p>\n<p>建议按照章节顺序学习，因为后续章节建立在前序知识之上。如果你已经在运营一家公司，可以优先阅读第三章合规部分和第四章中与你当前阶段最相关的内容。对于正在筹备创业的读者，第一章和第二章是最佳起点。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"company-formation","title":"公司设立与治理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/company-formation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"company-types","title":"公司类型与选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/company-formation/company-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"company-registration","title":"公司注册与设立","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/company-formation/company-registration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"corporate-governance","title":"公司治理结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/company-formation/corporate-governance"},{"seq":4,"slug":"shareholder-rights","title":"股东权利与义务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/company-formation/shareholder-rights"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"corporate-finance-law","title":"公司融资法律","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-finance-law","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"equity-financing","title":"股权融资","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-finance-law/equity-financing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"debt-financing","title":"债权融资","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-finance-law/debt-financing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"venture-capital","title":"风险投资法律实务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-finance-law/venture-capital"},{"seq":4,"slug":"equity-incentive","title":"股权激励","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-finance-law/equity-incentive"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"corporate-operations","title":"公司运营合规","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-compliance","title":"数据合规与隐私保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-operations/data-compliance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tax-basics","title":"税法基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-operations/tax-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"antitrust","title":"反垄断与反不正当竞争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-operations/antitrust"},{"seq":4,"slug":"regulatory-compliance","title":"行业监管与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-operations/regulatory-compliance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"corporate-restructuring","title":"公司变更与退出","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-restructuring","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mergers-acquisitions","title":"并购与重组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-restructuring/mergers-acquisitions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ipo-basics","title":"IPO 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-restructuring/ipo-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dissolution","title":"公司解散与清算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-restructuring/dissolution"},{"seq":4,"slug":"startup-legal","title":"创业公司法律实务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/corporate-law/corporate-restructuring/startup-legal"}]}]}